01:50:28.090 --> 01:50:30.140
And my heart goes out to the people

01:50:30.140 --> 01:50:33.750
who are still in dire straits,

01:50:33.750 --> 01:50:35.920
and they're in the thick of it.

01:50:35.920 --> 01:50:40.920
So, I don't have answers,
