Yeah, it has been such a difficult year.

01:51:04.070 --> 01:51:07.680
And like you said, it
continues to be very difficult.

01:51:07.680 --> 01:51:09.560
I think there is some light
at the end of the tunnel

01:51:09.560 --> 01:51:14.540
at this point, but there's
gonna be scars on families

01:51:16.170 --> 01:51:20.380
