01:51:20.380 --> 01:51:24.660
from just going through what
they've gone through this year.

01:51:24.660 --> 01:51:27.133
People's livelihoods, businesses,

01:51:29.075 --> 01:51:30.675
there's been so many challenges.

01:51:32.100 --> 01:51:36.000
Sometimes, I sort of imagine what,

01:51:38.040 --> 01:51:41.590
you know how when you're
sick with just like a cold,

01:51:41.590 --> 01:51:44.910
not anything like COVID, but just a cold,

01:51:44.910 --> 01:51:47.660
and you can't breathe out of your nose?

01:51:47.660 --> 01:51:49.250
And you think to yourself,

01:51:49.250 --> 01:51:53.480
man, when I can breathe in my nose again,

01:51:53.480 --> 01:51:55.100
I'm not gonna take it for granted.

01:51:55.100 --> 01:51:56.640
I'm gonna smell so hard.

01:51:56.640 --> 01:51:59.200
I'm gonna think about every breath .

01:51:59.200 --> 01:52:01.290
And then as soon as you can
breathe through your nose again,

01:52:01.290 --> 01:52:02.520
most time you don't even realize

01:52:02.520 --> 01:52:03.680
that you can breathe
through your nose again,

01:52:03.680 --> 01:52:05.480
you just go on about your business

01:52:05.480 --> 01:52:06.590
and breathe in through your nose

01:52:06.590 --> 01:52:09.670
like some professional athlete breather,

01:52:09.670 --> 01:52:11.120
taking it for granted.

01:52:11.120 --> 01:52:13.590
I think about what life is gonna be like.

01:52:13.590 --> 01:52:16.300
I think about being able
to just go to a restaurant

01:52:16.300 --> 01:52:18.160
without thinking about...

01:52:19.220 --> 01:52:20.610
I'm not going to any
restaurants right now,

01:52:20.610 --> 01:52:22.730
