01:52:26.203 --> 01:52:27.703
and whether you got a mask on,

01:52:28.820 --> 01:52:30.300
and just living life again,

01:52:30.300 --> 01:52:32.870
being able to hug somebody
without thinking about it,

01:52:32.870 --> 01:52:35.260
being able to gather with people again.

01:52:35.260 --> 01:52:37.960
Man, I hope I never take
that stuff for granted again.

01:52:38.970 --> 01:52:41.461
