up and put it in the drawer.

01:53:10.060 --> 01:53:14.453
And she was frugal and she
saved and she conserved.

01:53:15.570 --> 01:53:17.670
And it was because she had that mentality.

01:53:19.010 --> 01:53:22.683
I wonder sometimes, are
we gonna carry that?

01:53:25.770 --> 01:53:28.390
Can we get to the other side of the tunnel

01:53:28.390 --> 01:53:30.920
and not take for granted the things

01:53:33.151 --> 01:53:34.250
