collectively as a species,

01:53:41.160 --> 01:53:43.380
'cause like you said,
this is a global thing.

01:53:43.380 --> 01:53:44.670
Well, you know what?

01:53:44.670 --> 01:53:46.365
I think it's up to us.

01:53:46.365 --> 01:53:47.198
Yeah.

